  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Activity under preparation STRATEGIC COMMUNICATION 2025 &#xBF; 2028 ESWATINI</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">&lt;p&gt;The EU&#xBF;s strategic communication will raise awareness, understanding and perception of the EU, and garner support for the EU&#xBF;s priorities, values and interests in Eswatini. Furthermore, it will demonstrate the impact and positioning of the EU as a preferred partner for Eswatini.Strategic communication to implement large-scale, properly sequenced activities and campaigns around the cooperation priority area of Human Development and Social Inclusion and particularly the main action on skills for youth employability, entrepreneurship and empowerment in Eswatini.&lt;/p&gt;</narrative>
  </description>
